Firmware and submodule sources retain their original licence notices.
The kit collects compiled-source notices and both compiler runtime licences
in NOTICE.txt. The decoder licence is in stm_audio_bootloader/LICENSE;
the HAL licence is in tools/ST-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
